  "answer_text": "To log into your Microsoft OneDrive account, follow these simple steps depending on the device you are using:\n\n### 1. Web Browser (Any Device)\n* Go to the official [Microsoft OneDrive Sign-in Page](https://onedrive.live.com/about/signin/).\n* Enter your Microsoft email address, phone number, or Skype ID and click **Next**.\n* Enter your password and click **Sign in**.\n\n### 2. Windows PC or Mac (Desktop App)\n* **Windows:** Search for **OneDrive** in your Start menu (it is pre-installed on most Windows 10 and 11 computers). \n* **Mac:** Open the **OneDrive** app from your Applications folder (if you don't have it, you can download it from the Mac App Store).\n* Open the app, enter your Microsoft credentials, and follow the on-screen instructions to select which folders you want to sync.\n\n### 3. Mobile Device (Android or iOS)\n* Open the **OneDrive** app on your phone or tablet (you can download it for free from the Google Play Store or Apple App Store if you don't have it).\n* Open the app, tap **Sign in**, and enter your Microsoft email and password. \n\n*If you don't have an account yet, you can create a free one directly on the sign-in page.*",
